      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="pc5-note-0305" textAlignment="1">
        <bounds x="1140" y="20" width="340" height="410"/>
        <content>View name: Clinic Services Support View

Stakeholders: Clinic Manager, Lead Veterinarian

Concerns: Which information systems support the main clinic processes? Which processes would be affected if the Clinic EMR System became unavailable?

Purpose: Show how each step of a pet visit depends on application services and components.

Explanation: Booking depends on the Appointment Scheduling and Notification Gateway systems; examination and record updates depend on the Clinic EMR System; invoicing depends on the Billing System. An EMR outage therefore stops examinations and record updates.</content>
      </child>
    </element>
